_text","block_id":"GCit"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b28662d7-085e-48a5-b152-00b9cb7d6344","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/blob/master/skk.el#L266-L267\u003e\nddskk、実装的にモダンとは程遠い実装なのでちゃんと直したいが、この実装に依存してる人がいそうで直すに直せない。","ts":"1631066594.023900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/blob/master/skk.el | skk.el\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/blob/master/skk.el | skk.el\u003e","text":"```\n  (when skk-sticky-key\n    (require 'skk-sticky))\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk|skk-dev/ddskk\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ncT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae70e39d-12e1-4114-9012-d9b268b6e2a7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"emacs-ng か \u003chttps://github.com/emacs-ng/emacs-ng\u003e","ts":"1631066549.022900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"emacs-ng/emacs-ng","id":1,"title":"emacs-ng/emacs-ng","text":"A new approach to Emacs - Including TypeScript, Threading, Async I/O, and WebRender. ","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttps://emacs-ng.github.io/emacs-ng/\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"900","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vvx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cad6fbe8-a92e-47f9-a338-ffd43d23715d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"emacsにもdeno処理系の機運","ts":"1631066408.022500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":3,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U7JL1UKKL","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8sq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79ec7ee2-f971-470c-9385-bb8d31a932cb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"腕に覚えのある方はぜひ。。:bow:\n\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/issues/197\u003e","ts":"1631066382.022100","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/issues/197|#197 sticky-key使用時、まだ消費されていない文字が消える\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/issues/197|#197 sticky-key使用時、まだ消費されていない文字が消える\u003e","text":"「発する(はっする)」を入力したいと思います。  \nskkにおいてこれを入力するには「HasSuru」と入力する必要があります。  \n以下のように遷移します。\n\n```\ninput: HasSu\n\n▽h\t\t\t\t\t; H\n▽は\t\t\t\t\t; a\n▽はs\t\t\t\t\t; s\n▽はっ*s\t\t\t\t\t; S\n▼発す\t\t\t\t\t; u\n\n```\n\nしかし、sticky-keyを使用して入力する場合、消費されていない「s」がなぜか消えてしまうため入力することができません。\n\n```\ninput: ;has;su\n\n▽\t\t\t\t\t; ;\n▽h\t\t\t\t\t; h\n▽は\t\t\t\t\t; a\n▽はs\t\t\t\t\t; s\n▽は*\t\t\t\t\t; ;\n▽は*s\t\t\t\t\t; s\n▼馳す\t\t\t\t\t; u\n\n```\n\n*init.el*\n\n```\n(setq skk-sticky-key \";\")\n(require 'skk)\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk|skk-dev/ddskk\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1630304671}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w/0u"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631066309.021400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"8f127975-7345-4506-85d5-eeee18374e5e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1631030165286200\u003e\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1631065714314700?thread_ts=1631030165.286200\u0026amp;cid=CLKR04BEF\u003e\n\u003c@U9S4G0LJW\u003e この件ですが、ddskkのバグはここでした。 \u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/blob/6ed518435be2d8c6fe3cfb421f046c0f084dde9e/skk-sticky.el#L112\u003e\n\nこの設定はddskkに新しいアルファベット-\u0026gt;かな変換を与えるもので、この設定の意味は「「skk-sticky-keyを押したとき」に、「未消費文字をnilにして」「skk-sticky-set-henkan-pointを実行」する」という設定です。\nこれを修正するには「現在の未変換文字」を変数か関数で取れるようにしてnilのところに設定しないといけないのですが、そもそもここに変数とか関数を入れれるのかよく分からんなーということまで調べて投げた問題です。","ts":"1631066302.021000","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 7th, 2021 8:56 AM] conao3: そしてddskkのバグは修正難易度高め。Skkeletonで実装できてるのすごい。","id":1,"author_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","author_name":"Naoya Yamashita","author_subname":"Naoya Yamashita","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UDPT2BZ6E","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1a9a49807415fb97544a7383a9288b84.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0004-48.png","text":"そしてddskkのバグは修正難易度高め。Skkeletonで実装できてるのすごい。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Thread in #plugins","ts":1631030165.286200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1631030165286200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1631030165286200"},{"fallback":"[September 7th, 2021 6:48 PM] kuu: 気になってたんですが、これどんな問題です？","id":2,"author_id":"U9S4G0LJW","author_name":"kuu","author_subname":"kuu","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U9S4G0LJW","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2018-03-19/331496519296_b6fceab653cf61d7dd8b_48.png","text":"気になってたんですが、これどんな問題です？","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"From a thread in #plugins","ts":1631065714.314700,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1631065714314700?thread_ts=1631030165.286200\u0026amp;cid=CLKR04BEF","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1631065714314700?thread_ts=1631030165.286200\u0026amp;cid=CLKR04BEF"},{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/blob/6ed518435be2d8c6fe3cfb421f046c0f084dde9e/skk-sticky.el | skk-sticky.el\u003e","id":3,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk/blob/6ed518435be2d8c6fe3cfb421f046c0f084dde9e/skk-sticky.el | skk-sticky.el\u003e","text":"```\n               (cons `(,skk-sticky-key nil skk-sticky-set-henkan-point)\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skk-dev/ddskk|skk-dev/ddskk\u003e","footer_icon":"http